# variation 1 of b11: the state of the aspect is new in every call (D-133)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
driver b11_test1 is
  process main is
    new got :Integer;
    apply adder(10, 20, 30, @got);
    print got;
    apply adder(1, 1, 1, @got);
    print got;
  return;
end b11_test1;
/*@expect
{
  "stdout": [
    "60",
    "3"
  ]
}
*/
